---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
---

<BaseLayout title="The Open-Source Dietary Operations System for Senior Living">
  <!-- HERO SECTION -->
  <section class="relative pt-20 pb-28 overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-900/60 via-slate-950 to-slate-950">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center relative z-10">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-950/80 border border-blue-800/60 text-blue-400 text-xs font-bold mb-8 uppercase tracking-wider">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-blue-400 animate-pulse"></span> Built by a Senior Living Chef, Not a Silicon Valley VC
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-display font-black text-white tracking-tight max-w-5xl mx-auto leading-tight sm:leading-none mb-6">
        Dietary Ops for Senior Living Kitchens That Actually <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-400 to-teal-400">Cook Real Food.</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-slate-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-10 font-normal leading-relaxed">
        Connect resident dysphagia textures, tray cards, cycle menus, and <strong>Dennis Food Service</strong> order guides in one open-source, touch-optimized platform. Save $1.50–$3.00 per resident-day without proprietary software fees.
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4 max-w-md mx-auto mb-16">
        <a href="http://localhost:3000" class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 text-white font-bold rounded-xl text-base transition-all shadow-xl shadow-blue-600/30 flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
          <span>🚀</span> Test Live Interactive Demo
        </a>
        <a href="/pricing" class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 text-slate-200 border border-slate-800 font-bold rounded-xl text-base transition-all flex items-center justify-center">
          View Pricing ($199/mo)
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Metrics Bar -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 max-w-4xl mx-auto pt-8 border-t border-slate-800/80 text-left">
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-800">
          <div class="text-2xl font-display font-black text-blue-400">$1.50–$3.00</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">Saved per resident-day in food waste & over-ordering</div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-800">
          <div class="text-2xl font-display font-black text-teal-400">Zero Lock-In</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">Distributor-agnostic (Dennis, Sysco, US Foods)</div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-800">
          <div class="text-2xl font-display font-black text-amber-400">IDDSI Ready</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">Puree, mechanical soft, minced & nectar textures</div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-800">
          <div class="text-2xl font-display font-black text-purple-400">10-Min Setup</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">Import census CSV and start cooking immediately</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- THE INCUMBENT VS SHORELINE PROBLEM -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-slate-900/40 border-y border-slate-800/60">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-display font-bold text-white mb-4">Why Independent Facilities Are Leaving Legacy Dietary Software</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-400">
          Enterprise incumbents like MealSuite and CBORD charge $1,200+/mo and require 6-month enterprise onboarding. Meanwhile, small-to-mid facilities are trapped using messy paper binders.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
        <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-red-950/20 border border-red-900/40">
          <div class="text-red-400 font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">The Old Way (Legacy Software & Binders)</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Expensive, Locked-In & Cluttered</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-300">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-red-400 font-bold">✕</span> $800 to $1,500 monthly fees per building</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-red-400 font-bold">✕</span> Forces you into proprietary distributor contracts</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-red-400 font-bold">✕</span> Complicated menus that take weeks to update</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-red-400 font-bold">✕</span> Line cooks ignore the software because buttons are too small</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-red-400 font-bold">✕</span> Guesswork morning inventory walk-throughs</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-blue-950/30 border border-blue-800/50 relative overflow-hidden">
          <div class="text-blue-400 font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">The ShorelineOps Way</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Open-Source, Chef-Built & Practical</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-200">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-teal-400 font-bold">✓</span> Free self-hosted or $199–$399/mo supported cloud</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-teal-400 font-bold">✓</span> Open distributor integration (Dennis Food Service CSV ready)</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-teal-400 font-bold">✓</span> High-contrast <strong>Kitchen Tablet Mode</strong> cooks actually love</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-teal-400 font-bold">✓</span> Suggested PO generator (`Par Level - On Hand`) in 1 click</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-teal-400 font-bold">✓</span> Live Cost Per Resident Day ($/CPD) dashboard</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CORE APPLICATION CAPABILITIES -->
  <section id="features" class="py-24 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-20">
      <div class="text-blue-400 font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Core Platform Features</div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-display font-black text-white tracking-tight mb-4">
        Built for the Real Pressures of a Senior Living Kitchen
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-base sm:text-lg">
        Every screen was designed with greasy fingers, hot ovens, and rapid meal delivery carts in mind.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <!-- Feature 1 -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 hover:border-slate-700 transition-all">
        <div class="text-3xl mb-4">🍳</div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Kitchen Tablet Mode</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Cooks step through batch prep worksheets, verify internal temperatures (165°F), and check off items with large, touch-friendly buttons.
        </p>
        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-blue-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Line Cook Approved</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 2 -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 hover:border-slate-700 transition-all">
        <div class="text-3xl mb-4">⚠️</div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">IDDSI & Allergy Guard</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Bold red visual banners prevent serving allergen triggers or wrong texture profiles (Pureed, Minced & Moist, Mechanical Soft) to dysphagia residents.
        </p>
        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-teal-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Clinical Safety</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 3 -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 hover:border-slate-700 transition-all">
        <div class="text-3xl mb-4">🛒</div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Dennis Purchasing Sync</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Drop in your Dennis Food Service order guide CSV. Automatically generate suggested purchase orders when kitchen stock falls below par.
        </p>
        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Distributor Agnostic</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 4 -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 hover:border-slate-700 transition-all">
        <div class="text-3xl mb-4">📊</div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Cost Per Resident Day ($/CPD)</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Track real-time food spend and dietary labor costs against daily census counts. Eliminate budget surprises before the month closes.
        </p>
        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-emerald-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Financial Control</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 5 -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 hover:border-slate-700 transition-all">
        <div class="text-3xl mb-4">🖨️</div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">1-Click State Survey Audits</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
          When state health surveyors conduct unannounced annual inspections, print complete dietary compliance summaries and substitution logs instantly.
        </p>
        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-purple-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Survey Ready</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 6 -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 hover:border-slate-700 transition-all">
        <div class="text-3xl mb-4">🔒</div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">HIPAA Safeguards & BAA</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Append-only immutable audit logs, 10-minute idle session auto-logouts, 10-tier granular RBAC, and executed Business Associate Agreements.
        </p>
        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-rose-400 uppercase tracking-wider">100% Data Ownership</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CALL TO ACTION -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-blue-950/40 border-t border-blue-900/50 text-center">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-display font-black text-white mb-6">
        Ready to Test ShorelineOps in Your Kitchen?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-300 text-lg mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Experience the live evaluation sandbox or schedule a 15-minute practitioner-to-practitioner walkthrough.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="http://localhost:3000" class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 text-white font-bold rounded-xl text-base shadow-xl shadow-blue-600/30">
          Open Demo (admin@shoreline.demo)
        </a>
        <a href="https://github.com/ShadowWalkerNC/ShorelineOps" class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 text-slate-200 border border-slate-800 font-bold rounded-xl text-base">
          Star on GitHub ⭐
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
